1
00:00:00,861 --> 00:00:04,281
Sheldon, you got him in your sights. Fire!
He's charging his plasma rifle.

2
00:00:04,448 --> 00:00:07,238
- I can't shoot now, I'm cloaking.
- Now, Raj, kill Sheldon.

3
00:00:07,409 --> 00:00:08,449
(Raj:)I can't see him.

4
00:00:08,619 --> 00:00:11,119
That's why they call it cloaking,
dead man.

5
00:00:11,288 --> 00:00:14,038
(Leonard:)- Start throwing grenades.
- I'm all out.

6
00:00:14,625 --> 00:00:16,955
Hey, guys, my friends and I
got tired of dancing...

7
00:00:17,127 --> 00:00:19,377
(Penny(entering with three other sexy women):)...so we came over to have sex
with you.

8
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:21,046
Now, Raj, jump in the tank.

9
00:00:21,215 --> 00:00:24,255
- We said no tanks.
- There are no rules in hell.

10
00:00:24,426 --> 00:00:27,636
(Howard:)Son of a bitch.
Med-pack! I need a med-pack!

11
00:00:29,306 --> 00:00:30,726
Told you.

12
00:00:30,891 --> 00:00:33,141
(Leonard:)There's a sniper.
Use your rocket launcher.

13
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:35,560
(Raj:)All I've got is a needler
and I'm all out of ammo!

14
00:00:35,729 --> 00:00:38,479
(Sheldon:)And now you're out of life.

15
00:00:38,649 --> 00:00:39,859
[SOUNDS ON TV STOP]

16
00:00:40,025 --> 00:00:43,985
(Sheldon:)- Why did you hit pause?
- I thought I heard something.

17
00:00:44,154 --> 00:00:46,154
(Penny:)- What?
- No... Never mind.

18
00:00:46,323 --> 00:00:48,023
Sorry, go.

